## 2. Sales accounting integration

| Check | Status | Evidence |
|-------|--------|----------|
| Sales auto-create GL | ✅ | `postOrderSaleLedger` when `autoPostOnPaid` + paid order |
| Refunds reverse entries | ⚠ | `postOrderRefund` / `cogs_refund` proportional logic; staff must use tools correctly |
| Discounts post correctly | ✅ | Discount lines + metadata in `postOrderSaleLedger` |
| Taxes post correctly | ⚠ | Validation against `bills.tax` / lines; script `verify-invoice-tax-gap.js` suggests historical edge-case scrutiny |
| Payment methods map | ✅ | Config `paymentMethodAccounts` + splits |
| Customer debts tracked | ✅ | `on_account` billing increments `arBalance`; invoices |
| Partial payments | ✅ | `postArPayment` allocations + invoice `partial` status |
| Credit sales | ✅ | `billingMode === "on_account"` branch in `postOrderSaleLedger` |

### Issues (sales)

- 🔗 **HTTP contract** — `apps/pos-backend/controllers/orderController.js` — Responses include `accountingPosting` via `accountingPostingPayloadForResponse` / `accountingPostingFromOrder` — Clients must read payload; payment can succeed while GL fails. **Fix:** Document client requirement; consider optional 422 on GL failure.

