| Check | Status | Notes |
|-------|--------|--------|
| Transactions balance | ✅ | Mongoose validate on `JournalEntry` |
| Totals accurate | ⚠ | Rounding via `round2` / `balanceLinesWithRoundOff`; edge cases need regression tests |
