## 9. Security

| Topic | Status | Evidence |
|-------|--------|----------|
| Accounting RBAC | ✅ | `permissionsCatalog.js` — `backoffice.accounting.*`, granular AR/AP/GL/bank/periods |
| Route enforcement | ✅ | `accountingRoute.js` + `middlewares/backofficeAccounting.js` |
| Unauthorized edits | ⚠ | Standard API auth; **no** field-level GL locking beyond period close |
| Approval workflows | ⚠ | `ApprovalRequest` + optional posting gates; manual journals not gated in v1 |
| Audit logs | ✅ | `JournalAuditLog`, Studio `audit-log/page.tsx` |
| Financial record protection | ⚠ | Immutability by omission of PATCH; admins with write can still post reversing entries |

### Issues (security)

- ⚠ **Separation of duties** — Single user with `backoffice.accounting.write` + `gl.write` can post and reverse. **Fix:** Split permissions for reversal / period close already partially done (`periods.write`).

